<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Free Content Starter Kit — Victory Obongha</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,400;1,9..144,500&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#001241;
    --ink-soft:#0c2559;
    --mist:#ceced1;
    --mist-soft:#e4e4e6;
    --paper:#f7f6f4;
    --white:#ffffff;
    --gold:#c9a227;
    --gold-soft:#e3c65f;
    --text-dim: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
    --shadow: 0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,18,65,0.35);
    --ease: cubic-bezier(.16,.84,.44,1);
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    color:var(--ink);
    background:var(--paper);
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;
    font-weight:500;
    line-height:1.1;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:0.72rem;
    letter-spacing:0.18em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    font-weight:500;
    color:var(--gold);
  }
  .container{max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;}
  .reveal{
    opacity:0;
    transform:translateY(24px);
    transition:opacity 0.8s var(--ease), transform 0.8s var(--ease);
  }
  .reveal.is-visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .reveal{opacity:1 !important;transform:none !important;}
  }
 
  /* Nav */
  .nav{
    padding:22px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,18,65,0.08);
    background:rgba(247,246,244,0.9);
    backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;
  }
  .nav-inner{
    max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
  }
  .nav-logo{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:1.1rem;}
  .back-link{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:0.75rem;
    letter-spacing:0.05em;
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
    opacity:0.7;
    transition:opacity 0.25s ease;
  }
  .back-link:hover{opacity:1;}
 
  /* Hero */
  .kit-hero{
    padding:90px 0 60px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .kit-hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(2rem,4.4vw,3rem);
    margin:18px 0 20px;
  }
  .kit-hero p{
    max-width:560px;
    margin:0 auto;
    color:rgba(0,18,65,0.62);
    font-size:1.05rem;
    line-height:1.65;
  }
 
  /* Sections */
  .kit-section{padding:60px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,18,65,0.08);}
  .kit-section h2{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,2.6vw,1.9rem);margin-bottom:14px;}
  .kit-section > .container > p.lead{
    color:rgba(0,18,65,0.62);
    font-size:1rem;
    line-height:1.65;
    max-width:640px;
    margin-bottom:34px;
  }
 
  /* Mix framework */
  .mix-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:18px;
  }
  .mix-card{
    background:var(--white);
    border:1px solid rgba(0,18,65,0.1);
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:28px 22px;
  }
  .mix-pct{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:1.8rem;
    font-weight:600;
    color:var(--gold);
    display:block;
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .mix-card h3{font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .mix-card p{font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(0,18,65,0.6);}
 
  /* Hooks */
  .hook-list{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:14px;
  }
  .hook-item{
    background:var(--white);
    border:1px solid rgba(0,18,65,0.1);
    border-left:3px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius:12px;
    padding:18px 22px;
    display:flex;
    gap:16px;
    align-items:flex-start;
  }
  .hook-num{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    color:var(--gold);
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:0.85rem;
    flex-shrink:0;
    padding-top:2px;
  }
  .hook-item p{font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.55;}
  .hook-item p em{font-style:italic;color:rgba(0,18,65,0.55);}
 
  /* Checklist */
  .check-list{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:12px;
  }
  .check-item{
    display:flex;
    gap:14px;
    align-items:flex-start;
    background:var(--white);
    border:1px solid rgba(0,18,65,0.1);
    border-radius:12px;
    padding:16px 20px;
  }
  .check-box{
    width:20px;height:20px;
    border-radius:5px;
    border:2px solid var(--gold);
    flex-shrink:0;
    margin-top:1px;
  }
  .check-item p{font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.5;}
  .check-item strong{display:block;margin-bottom:2px;}
 
  /* Final CTA */
  .kit-cta{
    background:var(--ink);
    color:var(--white);
    text-align:center;
    padding:90px 0;
    margin-top:20px;
  }
  .kit-cta h2{color:var(--white);font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.2rem);margin-bottom:16px;}
  .kit-cta p{color:var(--text-dim);max-width:480px;margin:0 auto 34px;line-height:1.6;}
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
    padding:15px 30px;
    border-radius:100px;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:0.78rem;
    letter-spacing:0.04em;
    font-weight:500;
    cursor:pointer;
    border:1px solid transparent;
    transition:transform 0.2s var(--ease), box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }
  .btn-primary{background:var(--gold);color:var(--ink);}
  .btn-primary:hover{box-shadow:0 16px 32px -12px rgba(201,162,39,0.55);transform:translateY(-2px);}
 
  footer{
    background:#000b26;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
    text-align:center;
    padding:34px 0;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:0.72rem;
  }
  footer a{opacity:0.8;}
  footer a:hover{color:var(--gold);}
 
  @media (max-width:700px){
    .mix-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
 
<nav class="nav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <span class="nav-logo">Victory Obongha</span>
    <a href="victory-obongha-portfolio.html" class="back-link">← Back to portfolio</a>
  </div>
</nav>
 
<section class="kit-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal">Free resource</span>
    <h1 class="reveal">The Content Starter Kit</h1>
    <p class="reveal">Three tools from my actual client toolkit: the content mix I plan every calendar around, hook formulas that stop the scroll, and the checklist I use to approve a month of content in under 20 minutes. No email required, just scroll and take what's useful.</p>
  </div>
</section>
 
<section class="kit-section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal" style="display:block;margin-bottom:10px;">01 · Framework</span>
    <h2 class="reveal">The 60-20-20 content mix</h2>
    <p class="lead reveal">Pure education bores. Pure promotion repels. This is the ratio I plan every content calendar around, and it's the reason accounts that post consistently still don't grow, the mix is off, not the effort.</p>
    <div class="mix-grid reveal">
      <div class="mix-card">
        <span class="mix-pct">60%</span>
        <h3>Educational</h3>
        <p>Builds authority. This is where your expertise does the talking, and quietly out-credentials anyone competing for the same attention with less experience.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mix-card">
        <span class="mix-pct">20%</span>
        <h3>Relatable</h3>
        <p>Builds trust and connection. The behind-the-scenes layer that shows there's a real person behind the feed, not just a brand voice.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mix-card">
        <span class="mix-pct">20%</span>
        <h3>Social proof</h3>
        <p>Builds desire. Answers the one question every silent scroller is asking before they reach out: does this actually work for someone like me?</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
 
<section class="kit-section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal" style="display:block;margin-bottom:10px;">02 · Swipe file</span>
    <h2 class="reveal">8 scroll-stopping hook formulas</h2>
    <p class="lead reveal">The first line is the only line that counts. These are formulas, not fill-in-the-blank templates, so they still sound like you when you use them.</p>
    <div class="hook-list reveal">
      <div class="hook-item"><span class="hook-num">01</span><p>Name the exact thought your audience has at 11pm. <em>"I posted four times this week and gained eleven followers."</em></p></div>
      <div class="hook-item"><span class="hook-num">02</span><p>Correct a myth without naming who's spreading it. <em>"Your [problem] doesn't need a quick fix. It needs consistency and someone who knows your history."</em></p></div>
      <div class="hook-item"><span class="hook-num">03</span><p>Validate a frustration before you explain anything. <em>"If you've been told to just [common advice] and it made things worse, this is why."</em></p></div>
      <div class="hook-item"><span class="hook-num">04</span><p>Open mid-story so people need to know how it ends. <em>"She'd been told for three years that it was 'just stress.' Six weeks in, this is what changed."</em></p></div>
      <div class="hook-item"><span class="hook-num">05</span><p>Say the thing people are embarrassed to admit. <em>"I almost didn't post this because it felt too honest. Posting it anyway."</em></p></div>
      <div class="hook-item"><span class="hook-num">06</span><p>Lead with a stat that reframes the problem. <em>"90% of [your audience] never got formal training in [skill]. It shows, and it's not their fault."</em></p></div>
      <div class="hook-item"><span class="hook-num">07</span><p>Name the private search they've already made. <em>"If you've been quietly Googling '[your service] near me' at 11pm, I see you."</em></p></div>
      <div class="hook-item"><span class="hook-num">08</span><p>Defend your approach from the most common misread. <em>"[Your method] is not [common misconception]. Here's what it actually means."</em></p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
 
<section class="kit-section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal" style="display:block;margin-bottom:10px;">03 · Workflow</span>
    <h2 class="reveal">The monthly content approval checklist</h2>
    <p class="lead reveal">What I run every batch of content through before it goes out, whether it's mine or a client's. Takes under 20 minutes for a full month.</p>
    <div class="check-list reveal">
      <div class="check-item"><div class="check-box"></div><p><strong>Voice accuracy</strong>Read it out loud. Would you actually say this to a client, or does it sound borrowed?</p></div>
      <div class="check-item"><div class="check-box"></div><p><strong>Niche specificity</strong>Could this post belong to any account in your space, or only yours?</p></div>
      <div class="check-item"><div class="check-box"></div><p><strong>Ethical/brand compliance</strong>No language you wouldn't stand behind, no claims you can't back up.</p></div>
      <div class="check-item"><div class="check-box"></div><p><strong>CTA alignment</strong>Soft CTA roughly every 3rd post, direct CTA roughly every 5th. Nothing posted with zero path forward.</p></div>
      <div class="check-item"><div class="check-box"></div><p><strong>Visual consistency</strong>Same colour palette, same font system, so your feed is recognisable before anyone reads a word.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
 
<section class="kit-cta">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="reveal">Want this handled for you?</h2>
    <p class="reveal">This is a fraction of what goes into managing an account properly. If you'd rather hand it off, let's talk about what that could look like for you.</p>
    <a href="https://cal.com/obongha-victory/15min" class="btn btn-primary reveal">Book a Free Discovery Call</a>
  </div>
</section>
 
<footer>
  <div class="container">
    © 2026 Victory Obongha · <a href="victory-obongha-portfolio.html">Back to portfolio</a>
  </div>
</footer>
 
<script>
const revealEls = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
  entries.forEach(entry => {
    if(entry.isIntersecting){
      entry.target.classList.add('is-visible');
      io.unobserve(entry.target);
    }
  });
}, { threshold: 0.12 });
revealEls.forEach(el => io.observe(el));
</script>
 
</body>
</html>
